(footprint "NINA-B400-55_PLACEHOLDER"
	(version 20240108)
	(generator "uwb_rescue_locator_lib_builder")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "PLACEHOLDER footprint for u-blox NINA-B400 (NINA-B400-00B), Bluetooth 5.1 / nRF52833 module with ON-MODULE U.FL antenna connector, 55 signal pads + EGP + EAGP, body 15.0 x 10.0 x 2.23 mm. CONFIRMED from u-blox NINA-B40 series data sheet UBX-19049405 R09: body outline (Table 20: A=15.0 length, B=10.0 width, C=2.23 thickness), total pad count, and pad arrangement per Figure 3 pin assignment top view -- pins 1-10 left column, 11-15 bottom row, 16-25 right column, 26-46 inner ring, 47-55 top outer row. Pad sizes confirmed from Figure 8 dimension list (I=0.70 width / J=1.15 length lateral; O=0.70 square central, inner and outer; P=1.15 central pitch; Q=1.10 inner-row pitch; S=1.00 outer-row pitch; H=1.00 lateral pitch; E=0.875 vertical edge to pin 1). DEVIATION WORTH KNOWING: dimension E (0.875 vertical edge to pin 1 center) could NOT be honored together with the Figure 3 arrangement -- Figure 3 clearly shows the 47-55 outer row ABOVE the pin-1 lateral row, which cannot coexist with pin 1 sitting 0.875 mm from that same edge. Figure 8 appears to be drawn in a different (landscape) orientation from Figure 3, so its D/E/T/U origin references do not map unambiguously onto the Figure 3 frame. The pads here are therefore laid out self-consistently (no overlaps, all inside the body outline) rather than to E -- which is precisely why this is a PLACEHOLDER and NOT fabricable as-is. INDIVIDUAL PAD X/Y POSITIONS ARE ESTIMATES derived from those dimensions, NOT independently measured -- Figure 8 is a drawing whose per-rank origin references could not be resolved unambiguously from the datasheet text, and u-blox's official Eagle library (ubloxLib.lbr) contains only NINA111-42 / NINA112-42, no NINA-B3/B4 package. The EGP 3x3 array and the four EAGP antenna-area pads are positioned by proportion from Figure 3, not by dimension. VERIFY THE FULL LAND PATTERN against UBX-19049405 R09 Figure 8 (and the NINA-B3 land pattern, which the datasheet states is compatible) BEFORE FABRICATION. Flagged PLACEHOLDER per this project's convention -- same treatment as DWM3000_PLACEHOLDER.")
	(tags "u-blox NINA-B400 nRF52833 BLE 5.1 module LGA castellated PLACEHOLDER")
